The HTTP status code mirrors the payload's `status`/`code` (clamped to 100–599).

| Status | Meaning |
|--------|--------|
| `400` | Bad request / Validation error |
| `401` | Authentication required |
| `403` | Permission denied / Invalid CSRF |
| `404` | Document or action not found |
| `500` | Server error |

